WEBVTT

00:51:29.850 --> 00:51:31.178
and you'd better know it.

00:51:31.202 --> 00:51:32.704
EG: And that's a bow down.

00:51:32.728 --> 00:51:34.013
CA: What's a bow down?

00:51:34.037 --> 00:51:35.760
EG: You know, that's humility.

00:51:35.784 --> 00:51:37.163
And it is true.

00:51:37.187 --> 00:51:39.478
And you don't get to know why.

00:51:39.502 --> 00:51:41.806
You don't get to know why.
You're not allowed to.

00:51:41.830 --> 00:51:45.846
Those answers aren't for you,
and they've never been for anyone.

00:51:45.870 --> 00:51:48.828
For all of time, nobody
gets to see into that,

00:51:48.852 --> 00:51:51.841
and that, again, is part
of that warehouse of mystery

00:51:51.865 --> 00:51:54.239
that I'm growing more
and more comfortable with.

00:51:54.263 --> 00:52:00.149
Like, you don't get to see
why this goes this way.